s":[["1","","","","queued","","","",""]]}]},{"id":"sec-goal-units","anchor":"## 🎯 Goal 单元表（Rule 66.1 — attest 获批后填写）","level":2,"kind":"ref","ref":{"path":"goals","renderer":"goal_unit_table"},"required":true},{"id":"sec-s19","anchor":"## Phases 派发表骨架（S-unit 10 列固定列序——check-plan-dispatch.sh $4/$5/$7/$8 定位，禁增列/禁单元格管道转义；类别=目标列内（An）前缀）","level":2,"kind":"blocks","required":true,"blocks":[{"id":"table","kind":"table","header":["ID","目标(≤1 句)","执行体(subagent_type(model))","输入(路径 + ≤10 行摘要)","验收(可观察)","预估时长","粒度(三值)","伴飞技能","前置依赖","状态"],"rows":[["S1","（A6）","继承","","","10min","1f/10l/10min","无","-","pending"]]}]},{"id":"sec-batch-report","anchor":"## 📦 Batch Report（Rule 18.6 — 留空会被 check-complete 拦）","level":2,"kind":"blocks","required":true,"blocks":[{"id":"table","kind":"table","header":["字段","值"],"rows":[["`total`","n/a（<一句理由>）"],["`success`","n/a"],["`failed`","n/a"],["`failure_rate`","n/a"],["`sampled_pass`","n/a"],["`sampled_fail`","任务 <5 单元不触发抽样"],["`pre_check`","Q1:否 / Q2:无共享写 / Q3:能"],["`rollback_point`","<worktree 分支，合并前可弃>"]]}]},{"id":"sec-s21","anchor":"## 🧩 输出示例与格式契约（Rule 113）","level":2,"kind":"blocks","required":true,"blocks":[{"id":"note","kind":"markdown","text":"> 必填：本类型计划中凡声明输出格式/结构的交付物，均须在 `plan-state.json.output_examples` 登记至少 1 条完整示例 + 1 个同结构可复用模板（经 `planctl add --section output_examples` 写入），由 `planctl render` 派生到 task_plan.md 同名区块。禁止只写「输出为 JSON」等无样例声明；禁「略/同上/TBD」。"},{"id":"table","kind":"table","header":["交付物","格式","完整示例（fenced，见下方）","可复用模板（占位符版，见下方）","对应 VC"],"rows":[["code-change-manifest.json","JSON","见下方示例代码块","见下方模板代码块","VC-2, VC-3"]]},{"id":"note-2","kind":"markdown","text":"**完整示例（可直接查看、可比对）**：\n```json\n{\n  \"task\": \"配置解析器编辑\",\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\"file\": \"src/parser.ts\", \"symbol\": \"parseConfig\", \"change_type\": \"modify\", \"lines_added\": 12, \"lines_removed\": 4}\n  ],\n  \"vc_refs\": [\"VC-2\", \"VC-3\"]\n}\n```\n**可复用模板（占位符版，供执行期复制）**：\n```json\n{\n  \"task\": \"<PLACEHOLDER>\",\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\"file\": \"<PLACEHOLDER>\", \"symbol\": \"<PLACEHOLDER>\", \"change_type\": \"<PLACEHOLDER>\", \"lines_added\": \"<PLACEHOLDER>\", \"lines_removed\": \"<PLACEHOLDER>\"}\n  ],\n  \"vc_refs\": [\"<PLACEHOLDER>\"]\n}\n```\n填写纪律：① 示例与模板的字段集/层级必须一致；② 示例必须自包含可查看（JSON 须合法可解析、表格须有表头+≥1 行数据）；③ 无格式交付物时显式写 `none-justified（理由）`，禁留空；④ 示例的 `vc_refs` 至少映射 1 个已存在 VC（Rule 113.4）。"}]}]}
